      "title": "peektagged: make peektagged_skip_cpid() a general block skipper.",
      "message": "peektagged: make peektagged_skip_cpid() a general block skipper.\n\nNo need for it to check the section ID, that's already been checked by\nour caller.\n\nThis also means it can be used to skip other block types.\n\nWhile we're at it, make section_id an array of char, as the values are\ncomposed of ASCII characters (including DEL).\n",
      "author_name": "Guy Harris",
      "author_email": "gharris@sonic.net",
